  "properties": {
    "title": "NGV/survey: Offline data collection in 3D",
    "description": "[NGV/Survey3d](https://github.com/geoblocks/ngv/tree/master/src/apps/survey) is a customizable web application to collect data, in 3D, while offline. This application was commissioned by [Historic Environment Scotland](https://www.historicenvironment.scot/) and developed in partnership with Camptocamp. It is opensource, based on CesiumJS.\r\n\r\nSwitch to offline mode, then:\r\n- navigate the scene;\r\n- see all POIs, filter them;\r\n- add or edit POIs;\r\n- fill in your form;\r\n- load pictures;\r\n- ... and synchronize to your backend when back online.\r\n\r\nThe application can be fully customized with:\r\n- your collection areas;\r\n- your 3d tilesets;\r\n- your imagery;\r\n- your form properties and its rules;\r\n- your backend APIs;\r\n- your authentication system.\r\n\r\nMany tools are available:\r\n- measures;\r\n- coordinates in local projection;\r\n- clipping polygons.",
    "start_datetime": "2025-07-16T12:00:00Z",
